branchcards=''
for mode,bid in [('light','rational-humanistic'),('dark','dark-tech')]:
 b=profile['branches'][bid]
 branchcards+=f'<article class="branch mimo-scope" data-mimo-mode="{mode}">{meta("BRANCH / "+mode.upper())}<div class="branch-signal" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><h3 class="branch-title">{b["label"]}</h3><p>{b["tone"]}。与另一分支共享语义、结构和资源，不强制复制同一构图。</p><div class="swatches" aria-label="分支色板">'+''.join(f'<span class="swatch" style="background:{b["color"][k]}" title="{k}: {b["color"][k]}"></span>' for k in ['canvas','surface','raised','ink','muted','accent'])+'</div></article>'
labbar='''<div class="labbar"><div class="mimo-segments" role="tablist" aria-label="场景表达"><button id="tab-research" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="scene-research" tabindex="0" data-scene="research">Research / 研究</button><button id="tab-developer" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="scene-developer" tabindex="-1" data-scene="developer">Developer / 开发</button><button id="tab-workspace" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="scene-workspace" tabindex="-1" data-scene="workspace">Workspace / 工作</button></div><div class="right"><button id="text-toggle" type="button" class="mimo-button secondary" aria-pressed="false">长英文测试</button><button id="edit-toggle" type="button" class="mimo-button secondary" aria-pressed="false">编辑文字</button></div></div>'''
specimen='<div class="specimen" id="specimen"><div class="spec-top"><strong>MiMo-inspired / <span id="scene-name">RESEARCH</span></strong><span class="spec-extra">SAME IDENTITY · OPEN COMPOSITION</span><span id="mode-label">理性人文</span></div>'+''.join(f'<section class="scene-panel" id="scene-{name}" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-{name}" {"hidden" if name!="research" else ""}>{content}</section>' for name,content in SCENES.items())+'<div class="scene-foot"><span>原创可编辑样例 · 非小米官网复制</span><span>Skin 换肤保留内容和布局 / 不包含 AI 服务</span></div></div>'
editorfooter='''<div class="editor-footer"><button class="mimo-button secondary" id="export-html" type="button">导出可编辑 HTML ↗</button><button class="mimo-button secondary" id="export-project" type="button">导出项目 JSON</button><button class="mimo-button secondary" id="import-project" type="button">导入项目 JSON</button><input id="project-file" type="file" accept="application/json,.json" hidden><p>文字修改仅保留在本次页面会话。导出后可以再次打开；此为样例格式，不是 SP 原生项目。</p></div>'''
body=f'''
<a class="skip-link" href="#main">跳到主要内容</a>
<div class="shell"><header class="masthead"><a class="brand" href="#"><span class="name">mimo</span><span class="edition">PERSONAL DESIGN LANGUAGE<br>独立设计语言 · 2.0</span></a><nav class="mastnav" aria-label="主要导航"><a href="#principles">设计理念</a><a href="#specimens">场景表达</a><a href="#motion">动效语言</a><a href="#reuse">开放复用</a></nav><div class="global-actions"><button type="button" id="motion-toggle" class="mimo-button quiet" aria-pressed="false">减少动态</button><button type="button" id="mode-toggle" class="mimo-button secondary" aria-pressed="false">暗黑科技 ↗</button></div></header>
<main id="main"><section class="hero"><div>{meta('PERSONAL LIBRARY / MIMO-INSPIRED / V2.0')}
<h1>能力要强，<br><span class="echo">表达要清晰。</span></h1><p class="intro">一门以文字建立秩序、以工具承载内容、以运动解释关系的设计语言。<br>克制不是少做，而是让每一次表达都有理由。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="mimo-button" href="#specimens">进入设计样例 <span class="mimo-icon-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="mimo-button secondary" href="#motion">体验标志性动效</a></div></div>
<div class="hero-figure">{svg}<div class="figure-top"><span>FIG. 01 / QUIET CONTOUR<br>原创路径 · 无品牌素材依赖</span><span>01—02</span></div><div class="figure-thesis" lang="en">Intelligence,<br>in human<br>terms.</div><div class="figure-bottom"><span>RATIONAL TECHNICAL HUMANISM</span><span>OPEN BY DESIGN ↗</span></div></div></section>
<div class="release-rail"><span class="mimo-meta">PERSONAL RELEASE 2.0 / 非小米官方设计系统</span><div class="facts"><span><strong>02</strong>视觉分支</span><span><strong>03</strong>场景表达</span><span><strong>10</strong>动效资源</span></div></div>
<section class="section" id="principles">{sectionhead('00','清晰、有能力，也有人情味。','设计语言保持稳定的判断，但不把页面锁成模板。以下是创作方向，不是强模型必须逐条照做的执行表。')}
<div class="principles"><article class="principle"><h3>文字构成结构 / Type as architecture</h3><p>让标题、编号、细线和正文承担信息组织。中文保持舒展，英文允许更紧凑的展示节奏；不让所有内容都变成巨大标题。</p></article><article class="principle"><h3>工具就是内容 / Tools are content</h3><p>命令、输入、证据和任务状态不是装饰。操作必须真实，示例必须明确，人的意图不被界面外壳遮住。</p></article><article class="principle"><h3>克制而不冷漠 / Calm, not cold</h3><p>中性的工作底色配上温和的材料和局部强调。保留留白，也保留真实复杂性；深色不等于霓虹，浅色不等于空洞。</p></article><article class="principle"><h3>运动解释关系 / Motion carries meaning</h3><p>通过方向、焦点与连续身份解释变化，而非反复淡入。任何非必要运动都能停下，信息和操作不能随之消失。</p></article></div></section>
<section class="section" id="branches">{sectionhead('01','两个分支，一种设计身份。','理性人文与暗黑科技是两种表达，不是两个产品。Research、Developer、Workspace 是场景，不新增为六套主题。')}
<div class="branches">{branchcards}</div><p class="notes-line">分支名称可追溯至官方 Studio 更新。这里的色值、材料和交互调校是个人设计语言的原创定值，不是官网 CSS 测量结果。</p></section>
<section class="section" id="specimens">{sectionhead('02','换一个场景，身份仍然成立。','同一套资源用于研究页面、开发者界面和工作区。可以直接编辑文字，切换视觉分支，或用长英文检验真实内容的适应性。','BOTH / IMAGES + EDITABLE SOURCES')}{labbar}{specimen}{editorfooter}</section>
<section class="section" id="motion">{sectionhead('03','不是更多动画，而是更好的解释。','五种标志性动效，五种通用反馈。选择一项播放、暂停、重置或拖动时间，资源可以独立复用，也可以重新编排。','LANGUAGE / NOT A TIMELINE TEMPLATE')}
<div class="motion-bench"><aside class="motion-list" aria-label="选择动效资源">{buttons}</aside><div class="motion-body"><div class="motion-description"><div><h3 id="motion-title">索引描线</h3><p id="motion-meaning">沿编号建立阅读路径。</p></div><span class="duration" id="motion-duration">520 ms</span></div><div class="motion-stage" id="motion-stage"><div class="motion-demo" id="motion-root">{MOTION_SCENES['index-trace']}</div></div><div class="motion-controls"><button type="button" class="mimo-button" id="motion-play">播放 / 重播</button><button type="button" class="mimo-button secondary" id="motion-pause">暂停</button><button type="button" class="mimo-button secondary" id="motion-reset">重置</button><label><span class="mimo-sr">动效进度</span><input type="range" min="0" max="100" value="0" id="motion-seek"></label><output id="motion-percent" for="motion-seek">0%</output></div><p class="motion-policy" id="motion-policy">用于索引、章节开启；不是每个段落都强制播放。</p></div></div><p class="notes-line">所有资源为本次原创实现。默认不自动循环；减少动态模式直接呈现最终可读状态。运行库不依赖 GSAP、SP 或联网资源。</p></section>
<section class="section" id="foundations">{sectionhead('04','有默认值，但没有固定答案。','语义色、文字层级、间距和材质形成可复用基础。默认值保证起点可靠，不规定一页必须有几栏、几个卡片或多少留白。')}
<div class="foundations"><div><div class="palette" id="palette"></div><div class="token-foot"><span id="contrast-readout">正在读取当前分支参数</span><button class="mimo-button secondary" id="export-tokens" type="button">导出设计配置 ↗</button></div></div><div class="type-test"><div class="mimo-meta">TYPOGRAPHY / CJK + LATIN + CODE</div><h3>把话说清楚，<br>也把空间留下。</h3><p class="latin" lang="en">Less noise.<br>More possibility.</p><p>中文标题使用较舒展的行高与字距；拉丁展示标题可以更紧凑。正文优先可读性，代码使用等宽字体，标签不冒充正文。</p><code>question → evidence → understanding</code><p class="state-explanation">字体采用系统回退栈，不随包分发字体文件。不同电脑可能出现字形和换行差异，不能宣称像素级一致。</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="components">{sectionhead('05','状态完整，才是可用的设计。','组件是可选词汇，不是创作围栏。这里验证操作反馈、输入错误、键盘焦点、禁用态、弹层与信息密度。')}
<div class="components-grid"><section class="component-unit"><h3>01 / ACTION & CONTROL</h3><div class="row"><button type="button" class="mimo-button" id="primary-demo">确认操作 ↗</button><button type="button" class="mimo-button secondary" id="open-dialog">打开弹层</button></div><div class="row"><button type="button" class="mimo-button secondary" disabled>不可用</button><button type="button" class="mimo-button secondary" id="loading-demo">模拟处理中</button></div><label class="control-label"><input type="checkbox" id="check-demo" checked>保留人的控制权</label><div class="radio-demo"><label class="control-label"><input type="radio" name="density" value="comfortable" checked>舒适</label><label class="control-label"><input type="radio" name="density" value="compact">紧凑</label></div><p class="state-explanation">Hover、focus、pressed、disabled 与 busy 各有反馈。密度选项只改变下方示例表格，不重排整页。</p></section>
<section class="component-unit"><h3>02 / INPUT & VALIDATION</h3><label class="mimo-field" for="name-input">项目名称<input id="name-input" autocomplete="off" placeholder="输入一个名称" aria-describedby="name-feedback" aria-invalid="false"><small id="name-feedback">用于验证错误与成功状态，不发送到服务器。</small></label><button class="mimo-button secondary" type="button" id="validate-name" style="margin-top:15px">验证名称</button><div class="row" style="margin-top:24px"><span class="mimo-badge success">✓ 就绪</span><span class="mimo-badge warning">! 待检查</span></div><p class="state-explanation">信息不只靠颜色表达。错误不会清空输入；修正后可以继续完成操作。</p></section>
<section class="component-unit"><h3>03 / DISCLOSURE & EMPTY STATE</h3><details class="mimo-details"><summary>为什么布局不是必选？</summary><p class="state-explanation">因为页面结构由内容决定。预设只能提供起点，AI 可以自由创造新构图和新的可编辑组件。</p></details><div class="blank-diagnostic" style="margin-top:21px"><div class="mimo-meta">NO SAVED REFERENCES</div><p>先留下一个好的例子。</p><button class="mimo-button secondary" type="button" id="save-reference">收藏当前样例</button><p class="state-explanation" id="reference-feedback">收藏只在本次页面会话内保存。</p></div></section>
<section class="component-unit span2"><h3>04 / READABLE DATA</h3><table class="mimo-table" id="density-table"><caption>资源清单示例 · 非性能跑分</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">资源</th><th scope="col">类型</th><th scope="col">状态</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Index Trace</td><td>标志性动效</td><td>可复用</td></tr><tr><td>Quiet Contour</td><td>原创 SVG</td><td>可编辑</td></tr><tr><td>Research specimen</td><td>HTML 样例</td><td>可导出</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section class="component-unit"><h3>05 / LOCAL EMPHASIS</h3><div class="binding-demo"><span class="linked" id="linked-style">关联主题色</span><span data-fixed-ink id="fixed-style">固定样式</span></div><p class="state-explanation">顶部换肤时，前者跟随语义色，后者保留自己的配色。关联以属性为单位；不区分是谁——人或 AI——做的修改。</p></section></div></section>
<section class="section" id="reuse">{sectionhead('06','给模型知识，不给模型围栏。','强模型需要明确的身份与真实的资源，不需要每页都重复的十步指令。主题、布局、动效与平台适配彼此解耦。','OPTIONAL / LANGUAGE / SKIN / BOTH / SHARED')}
<div class="reuse-grid"><div><h3>创作可超出所有样例。</h3><p>先理解本次要表达什么，再选择需要的设计知识。布局和组件可以不用，动效可以重组；新增内容仍应保持清晰、真实、可读和可控制。</p><pre class="small-code">MiMo design language\n  ├─ Identity + semantic tokens\n  ├─ Rational Humanistic / Dark Tech\n  ├─ Optional resources + references\n  └─ Product adapters\n       Web / Docs / App / SP</pre><p>Skin 只更新关联的样式，不改内容、坐标或已有时间轴。Adapt 是有意的风格协调；Redesign 才允许重新构图。</p><button type="button" class="mimo-button secondary" id="open-principles-dialog">查看 AI 使用摘要 ↗</button></div>
<div><h3>参考可追溯，设计归自己。</h3><ul class="source-list"><li><a href="https://support.claude.com/en/articles/14604397-set-up-your-design-system-in-claude-design" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Claude Design / 方法依据 <span>↗</span></a><small>从真实资料提炼系统，再用新作品检验，而不是仅收集色板。</small></li><li><a href="https://mimo.xiaomi.com/zh" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MiMo Research / 文字与索引 <span>↗</span></a><small>观察信息结构，不宣称已取得官网字体与计算样式。</small></li><li><a href="https://mimo.xiaomi.com/coder?lang=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MiMo Code / 工具与人文表达 <span>↗</span></a><small>参考真实命令入口及官方图像，不分发其 Logo、插图或字体。</small></li><li><a href="https://mimo.mi.com/docs/zh-CN/updates/feature/studio" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MiMo Studio / 两种视觉分支 <span>↗</span></a><small>名称有官方出处；跨产品语义参数为原创设计。</small></li></ul><p class="notes-line">官方来源只用于验证观察。这里没有调用 Claude Design 服务，也没有修改 SP、Lumina 或 Noema。</p></div></div></section>
</main><footer class="foot"><strong>mimo / personal edition.</strong><p>MiMo-inspired Design Language 2.0.0 · 原创个人设计语言<br>不是小米官方组件库，不包含品牌素材、账号信息、外部脚本或字体文件。展示数据与任务过程均已标明为样例。</p><span>2026 / DESIGN SYSTEMS<br>FORM FOLLOWS UNDERSTANDING.</span></footer></div>
<dialog class="mimo-dialog" id="demo-dialog" aria-labelledby="dialog-title"><h2 id="dialog-title">保持控制，也保持连续。</h2><p>弹层是一次局部层级变化。关闭后焦点回到原按钮；Esc 可以退出。Skin 换肤不改写你的内容或已编排的动画。</p><div class="dialog-actions"><button class="mimo-button" type="button" id="close-dialog">明白，返回</button></div></dialog>
<dialog class="mimo-dialog" id="ai-dialog" aria-labelledby="ai-dialog-title"><h2 id="ai-dialog-title">MiMo / AI 设计上下文</h2><p>以清晰的文字层级、真实的工具内容、克制而有人情味的材料，以及解释关系的运动建立身份。</p><p>默认值可覆盖，布局和组件可不用。可以创造新的构图、图形和动效；不要把示例当成必须复刻的模板。保留内容真实性、可访问性与用户已固定的设计选择。</p><p>资源按需读取：身份 → 对应场景 → 需要的样例或动效。此说明是设计上下文，不是自动安装的 MCP 技能。</p><div class="dialog-actions"><button class="mimo-button" type="button" id="close-ai-dialog">返回创作</button></div></dialog>
<div id="toast" class="mimo-toast" role="status" hidden></div><div class="mimo-sr" id="global-status" role="status"></div>
'''
CSS='\n'.join((R/p).read_text() for p in ['kit/tokens.css','kit/mimo.css','src/lab.css'])
JS='\n'.join((R/p).read_text() for p in ['kit/skin.js','kit/motion.js','src/lab.js'])
project={'format':'mimo-editable-specimen','schemaVersion':2,'mode':'light','scene':'research','texts':{}}
def make(body,mode='light',scene='research',is_example=False):
 state={**project,'mode':mode,'scene':scene}
 return '<!doctype html>\n<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer"><title>MiMo Design Language 2.0 · 独立设计语言</title><meta name="description" content="MiMo-inspired personal design language: two branches, open composition, ten original motion resources and editable offline specimens. Not an official Xiaomi product."><style>'+CSS+'</style></head><body class="mimo-scope'+(' example-page' if is_example else '')+'" data-mimo-mode="'+mode+'" data-mimo-motion="auto">'+body+'<script type="application/json" id="mimo-profile">'+safejson(profile)+'</script><script type="application/json" id="mimo-motions">'+safejson(manifest)+'</script><script type="application/json" id="mimo-motion-examples">'+safejson(MOTION_SCENES)+'</script><script type="application/json" id="mimo-project-state">'+safejson(state)+'</script><script>'+JS+'</script></body></html>'
save('dist/MiMo_Design_Language_v2.0.html',make(body))
# Independent examples are self-contained and carry the same editable model.
for mode in ['light','dark']:
 for name in SCENES:
  eb='<a class="skip-link" href="#main">跳到样例</a><div class="shell"><header class="example-head"><div><strong>MiMo-inspired / '+name.upper()+'</strong><div class="mimo-meta">PERSONAL DESIGN LANGUAGE · ORIGINAL EDITABLE SPECIMEN</div></div><div class="global-actions"><button id="motion-toggle" class="mimo-button secondary" type="button" aria-pressed="false">减少动态</button><button id="mode-toggle" class="mimo-button secondary" type="button" aria-pressed="'+str(mode=='dark').lower()+'">切换分支</button></div></header><main id="main">'+labbar+specimen+editorfooter+'</main><footer class="foot"><p>独立可编辑 HTML。命令只复制，不执行；工作区不连接 AI。编辑后请导出保存。</p><span>MiMo-inspired 2.0.0 / 非小米官方设计系统</span></footer></div><div id="toast" class="mimo-toast" role="status" hidden></div><div class="mimo-sr" id="global-status" role="status"></div>'
  save('examples/'+name+'.'+mode+'.html',make(eb,mode,name,True))
index={'languageId':profile['id'],'version':'2.0.0','references':[{'id':f'mimo.example.{scene}.{mode}','branch':mode,'scene':scene,'kind':'original-positive-reference','preview':'../preview/'+scene+'.'+mode+'.png','editableHtml':'../examples/'+scene+'.'+mode+'.html','editableStructure':'../examples/scene-source.json','meaning':{'research':'Editorial hierarchy, evidence and numbered direction.','developer':'Real command copy, low-chrome code and product context.','workspace':'Focused input, explicit mock task states and persistent user control.'}[scene]} for scene in SCENES for mode in ['light','dark']]}
save('evidence/visual-reference-index.json',json.dumps(index,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2))
print('Rendered main + six self-contained editable examples')
